    <briefdescription>
<para>Specialized handler for camera_data topics. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This handler provides full processing for camera messages:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Message downsampling (skip N frames)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Image scaling (resize to target dimensions)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>JPEG compression (reduce bandwidth)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Protobuf conversion (efficient Foxglove streaming)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Use this handler for camera topics where bandwidth optimization and image quality tradeoffs are needed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
